        <p id="owner-title" class="dialog-title">Change Company Owner</p>

        <div class="dialog-warning">
            <div class="warn-icon">
                <i class="bi bi-person-gear"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="warn-text">
                <p>Company Ownership Transfer</p>
                <p class="warn-sub">You are about to transfer ownership of the entire company to a new user.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="dialog-body">
            To change the company owner, please select the new owner below. All company records, settings, and ownership rights will be transferred.
        </div>

        <div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-start mb-2 mx-2">
            <h6 class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">New Company Owner <span class="text-danger">*</span></h6>
            <select class="dialog-select w-50" id="new-owner-select">
                <!-- Options populated dynamically -->
                <option value="">Select user...</option>
            </select>
        </div>

      @*   <div class="bd-callout bd-callout-info my-0 p-2 mx-2 bg-opacity-10">
            <strong>Note</strong>
            <br />
            <span class="smaller">
                • All records owned by the current owner will be transferred to the new owner (Requests, Estimates, Work Orders, Service Appointments, etc.).
                <br />
                • Crews owned or led by the current owner will be transferred.
                <br />
                • If the current owner is a field technician, their Timesheets, Trips, and Location tracking will be closed or stopped automatically.
                <br />
                <strong class="text-danger">This action cannot be easily undone.</strong>
            </span>
        </div> *@

        <div class="dialog-body">
            Please select <strong>Transfer Ownership</strong> to proceed with changing the company owner, or <strong>Cancel</strong> to return without making any changes.
        </div>

        <div class="bg-danger-subtle text-black small p-1 px-2 d-flex align-items-center gap-2 d-none">
            <i class="bi bi-exclamation-circle-fill text-danger"></i>
            Failed to transfer ownership. Please try again.
            <button class="read-more-btn text-black small">Read more</button>
        </div>

        <div class="dialog-footer">
            <button type="button" class="btn-cancel" data-fsm-transfer-cancel>Cancel</button>
            <button class="btn-confirm" id="fsm-change-owner-confirm">
                Transfer Ownership
            </button>
        </div>
